WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:06,590
I'm digging a hole down there

2
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:09,590
You two bitches, sit here and make love softly.

3
00:00:09,590 --> 00:00:10,590
I really don’t want to say it

4
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:13,680
It's a pity that I can't beat the trench coat

5
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,680
The monkey is back

6
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:17,100
Has it been opened?

7
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:19,450
How can it be so fast

8
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:22,800
However, I calculated that it would be less than three meters at most and I could dig through it.

9
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,860
Let me rest for a while before digging in the afternoon.

10
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:26,860
Only three meters left

11
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:27,860
Then why are you taking a break?

12
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:29,860
Dig in quickly

13
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:31,960
My lonely grandma

14
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:33,960
I am a human being

15
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:37,180
Are you really going to tire me out?

16
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:38,180
What's your tone?

17
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:43,700
Did I say anything?

18
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:45,700
I'm just a little tired of complaining.

19
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:49,200
Why do I have to apologize to you?

20
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:51,390
Why did I give you face?

21
00:00:51,390 --> 00:00:52,390
If it weren't for me

22
00:00:52,390 --> 00:00:58,110
Do you know that you can only stay in the library and wait for death for the rest of your life?

23
00:00:58,110 --> 00:00:59,110
But so beautiful

24
00:00:59,110 --> 00:01:01,110
How dare a man scold me?

25
00:01:01,110 --> 00:01:04,940
Okay, okay, baby, don't be angry

26
00:01:04,940 --> 00:01:06,940
The monkey is also exhausted

27
00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:08,940
Let's just say a few words and we won't cry.
